<title>SWITZERLAND: Daimler-Benz sees 96 profit at least 2 bln DM.</title>
<headline>Daimler-Benz sees 96 profit at least 2 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz board member Eckhard Cordes said on Monday the company would post 1996 group net profits of at least two billion marks.</p>
<p>Cordes was speaking on the fringes of the launch of the Mercedes A-Class small car at the Geneva motor show.</p>
<p>Management board chairman Juergen Schrempp said in a speech at the launch that &quot;almost all areas (of the company) had contributed&quot; to the 1996 result.</p>
<p>(( -- Bonn newsroom, +49 228 26097160.))</p>
</text>
